\" y=\"13\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><span class=\"Header_logoText__4ZhAR\">Creators Units</span></a><nav class=\"Header_menu__phTUR\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/tools\">Explore Tools</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/category/image\">Image Tools</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/category/creator\">Creator Tools</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t Header_linkActive__t3uQf\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/category/social\">Social Tools</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/category/utility\">Utility Tools</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"Header_actions__SRauh\"><button class=\"Header_themeToggle__nT4h5\" aria-label=\"Switch to dark mode\" title=\"Toggle to dark theme\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z\"></path></svg></button><button class=\"Header_menuToggle__cfdoi\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"main-content section\" id=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;font-size:0.85rem\"><ol style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;align-items:center\"><li><a style=\"color:var(--text-muted);text-decoration:none\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin:0 0.5rem;color:var(--text-muted)\">/</li><li aria-current=\"page\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary);font-weight:600\">Social Media Tools</li></ol></nav><div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.5rem;padding:2rem\"><h1 style=\"font-size:2.25rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem\">Social Media Tools</h1><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin:0;line-height:1.5\">Generate fancy fonts, custom bios, usernames, hashtags, WhatsApp links, and Link-in-Bio pages.</p></div><div class=\"grid-cols-3\" style=\"margin-bottom:3rem\"><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Fancy Text Generator - Convert plain text into stylized Unicode fonts for your bios, captions, and posts.\" href=\"/tools/social/fancy-text-generator\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">Fancy Text Generator</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Convert plain text into stylized Unicode fonts for your bios, captions, and posts.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Username Generator - Generate memorable and available username ideas based on your niche and keywords.\" href=\"/tools/social/username-generator\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">Username Generator</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Generate memorable and available username ideas based on your niche and keywords.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Bio Template Generator - Generate professional and creative bio outlines for Instagram, TikTok, and Twitter.\" href=\"/tools/social/bio-template-generator\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">Bio Template Generator</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Generate professional and creative bio outlines for Instagram, TikTok, and Twitter.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Social Character Counter - Count characters and words while checking limits for Twitter, Instagram, and Facebook.\" href=\"/tools/social/character-counter\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">Social Character Counter</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Count characters and words while checking limits for Twitter, Instagram, and Facebook.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Hashtag Composer Helper - Organize, combine, and copy sets of hashtags for your social uploads.\" href=\"/tools/social/hashtag-helper\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">Hashtag Composer Helper</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Organize, combine, and copy sets of hashtags for your social uploads.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open WhatsApp Link Generator - Generate instant chat links with custom pre-filled messages for your customers.\" href=\"/tools/social/whatsapp-link-generator\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">WhatsApp Link Generator</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Generate instant chat links with custom pre-filled messages for your customers.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open WhatsApp QR Code Generator - Create QR codes that automatically open a WhatsApp chat when scanned.\" href=\"/tools/social/whatsapp-qr-generator\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">WhatsApp QR Code Generator</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Create QR codes that automatically open a WhatsApp chat when scanned.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Social Link-in-Bio Helper - Design a simple, custom link-in-bio page and download it as a single-file static HTML page.\" href=\"/tools/social/social-media-link-in-bio-helper\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">Social Link-in-Bio Helper</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Design a simple, custom link-in-bio page and download it as a single-file static HTML page.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a></div><section class=\"card\" style=\"background-color:var(--bg-primary);padding:2rem\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem\">About Our <!-- -->Social Media Tools<!-- --> Suite</h2><div style=\"font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem\"><p>Make your profiles stand out. Use our social utilities to generate stylized text, brainstorm catchy usernames, compose optimized bios, or construct WhatsApp click-to-chat links. Plus, build a fully custom, single-file HTML Link-in-Bio landing page to direct your traffic without paying monthly subscription costs.</p><p>All utilities operate inside the client browser. No registration is required. Bookmark this index page to speed up your daily creation, design, and posting workloads.</p></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"Footer_footer__eNA9m\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"Footer_grid__WCfx6\"><div class=\"Footer_brandCol__6UIwg\"><a class=\"Footer_logo__8uCHD\" aria-label=\"Creators Units - Go to homepage\" href=\"/\"><svg class=\"Footer_logoIcon__WWDSF\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"8\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"13\" y=\"3\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"13\" y=\"13\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><span class=\"Footer_logoText__SzK4_\">Creators Units</span></a><p class=\"Footer_tagline__WuViG\">Free, fast, and secure online tools that help you design, optimize, and grow your digital presence. No installation required.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Categories</h3><ul class=\"Footer_linkList__K_ONQ\"><li><a class=\"Footer_link___mmVB\" href=\"/category/image\">Image Tools</a></li><li><a class=\"Footer_link___mmVB\" href=\"/category/creator\">Creator Tools</a></li><li><a class=\"Footer_link___mmVB\" href=\"/category/social\">Social Media Tools</a></li><li><a class=\"Footer_link___mmVB\" href=\"/category/utility\">Utility Tools</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Resources</h3><ul class=\"Footer_linkList__K_ONQ\"><li><a class=\"Footer_link___mmVB\" href=\"/tools\">All Tools</a></li><li><a class=\"Footer_link___mmVB\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a></li><li><a class=\"Footer_link___mmVB\" href=\"/contact\">Contact Form</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Legal</h3><ul class=\"Footer_li